WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.490 --> 00:00:11.470
Hey, welcome back to 40 Days of Holiness. Today is day 30.

2
00:00:11.760 --> 00:00:15.720
Holiness is wholeness. I need to show you the board here so you can hear

3
00:00:15.760 --> 00:00:19.580
the word. It's kind of hard to hear the right word. Wholeness or completeness.

4
00:00:20.140 --> 00:00:22.640
Today, we're in Malachi chapter three. Let's read.

5
00:00:23.870 --> 00:00:27.760
"I will send my messenger who will prepare the way before me,

6
00:00:28.100 --> 00:00:31.190
and then suddenly the Lord you are seeking will come to his

7
00:00:31.240 --> 00:00:35.180
temple. The messenger of the covenant whom you desire

8
00:00:35.200 --> 00:00:38.700
will come,' says the Lord Almighty. 'But who can endure the day of his coming?

9
00:00:38.760 --> 00:00:42.720
Who can stand when he appears? For he will be like a refiner's fire

10
00:00:42.780 --> 00:00:46.350
or a launderer's soap. He will sit as a refiner and

11
00:00:46.460 --> 00:00:50.150
purifier of silver, and he will purify the Levites

12
00:00:50.500 --> 00:00:53.420
and refine them like gold and silver.

13
00:00:53.440 --> 00:00:57.340
And then the Lord will have men who bring offerings in

14
00:00:57.380 --> 00:00:58.080
righteousness."

15
00:00:59.300 --> 00:01:02.060
They will be acceptable. Wholeness is wholeness.

16
00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:05.320
To be whole or healed physically is to be well.

17
00:01:05.660 --> 00:01:07.520
When you're ill, you're not whole.

18
00:01:07.580 --> 00:01:10.140
There's not full, whole physical health.

19
00:01:10.200 --> 00:01:13.890
Recently, my family and I got COVID, and we weren't whole. I ached.

20
00:01:14.360 --> 00:01:16.380
My wife lost her sense of taste and smell.

21
00:01:16.420 --> 00:01:19.980
There was something beyond us that was causing us not to

22
00:01:20.020 --> 00:01:22.000
be fully whole and well.

23
00:01:22.880 --> 00:01:26.440
There is a healed wholeness to holiness,

24
00:01:27.080 --> 00:01:30.540
to being holy. To be spiritually holy and

25
00:01:30.580 --> 00:01:34.340
pursuing holiness is to be whole and on a journey

26
00:01:34.400 --> 00:01:36.440
into full wholeness.

27
00:01:37.260 --> 00:01:40.960
The opposite of whole is mixed. God is holy

28
00:01:41.020 --> 00:01:44.340
because He is whole. He is not mixed with anything else.

29
00:01:44.740 --> 00:01:48.600
He is other. He's not mixed with anything impure.

30
00:01:49.080 --> 00:01:52.920
The old theologians used to talk about without alloy in

31
00:01:52.960 --> 00:01:56.590
the 1700s. That alloy was mixture.

32
00:01:56.620 --> 00:02:00.550
So how does this touch your life? Well, there's no place in this

33
00:02:00.600 --> 00:02:03.970
life of holiness for walling off part of you and saying,

34
00:02:04.230 --> 00:02:06.090
"Holiness doesn't touch this."

35
00:02:06.940 --> 00:02:09.269
You see, God wants to heal and make whole

36
00:02:10.180 --> 00:02:11.800
every part of you.

37
00:02:12.720 --> 00:02:15.560
Your emotions, your reactions, your words.

38
00:02:16.140 --> 00:02:18.500
He wants to heal the hurts of the past.

39
00:02:19.040 --> 00:02:21.320
He wants to deal with your insecurities.

40
00:02:22.109 --> 00:02:25.170
He wants to make you courageous instead of fearful and

41
00:02:25.220 --> 00:02:29.090
insecure. He wants to heal your mind, your

42
00:02:29.240 --> 00:02:31.900
thinking, and reprogram all the parts of you.

43
00:02:33.200 --> 00:02:36.120
Someone watching this is a product of pain.

44
00:02:37.020 --> 00:02:40.860
Other people's sins have marked you, and you feel as though you are

45
00:02:40.870 --> 00:02:44.380
not whole, you are not well, you are mixed, you are forever

46
00:02:44.580 --> 00:02:46.880
damaged, forever scarred, forever marked.

47
00:02:47.860 --> 00:02:51.400
And I'm here to tell you that God's holiness is coming to you to

48
00:02:51.480 --> 00:02:55.460
make all the parts of you whole and well

49
00:02:55.880 --> 00:02:56.660
and unmixed.

50
00:02:57.560 --> 00:03:00.269
Now, He may even use suffering and pain to do this.

51
00:03:00.650 --> 00:03:04.400
The purifier of silver that Malachi talked about would melt the

52
00:03:04.460 --> 00:03:08.290
silver down and skim off the impurities until he could see his

53
00:03:08.300 --> 00:03:11.090
reflection perfectly in the melted silver.

54
00:03:11.860 --> 00:03:14.780
And the purifying work of God is refining.

55
00:03:15.329 --> 00:03:18.850
He may even use trials and pain and counseling and grief and

56
00:03:19.020 --> 00:03:19.500
tears.

57
00:03:20.660 --> 00:03:24.460
The old songwriter said, "The flame shall not hurt

58
00:03:24.580 --> 00:03:27.620
thee. I only design thy dross to

59
00:03:27.660 --> 00:03:31.620
consume and thy gold to refine." And when

60
00:03:31.680 --> 00:03:35.510
that work is done, God says we can offer a sacrifice in

61
00:03:35.720 --> 00:03:39.060
righteousness, a sacrifice that measures up, one that is

62
00:03:39.420 --> 00:03:41.020
whole and not mixed.

63
00:03:41.950 --> 00:03:45.780
That's what you'll offer to God as one made holy, a

64
00:03:45.860 --> 00:03:47.200
whole one made holy.

65
00:03:48.400 --> 00:03:51.900
I felt strongly when I was preparing for this one that someone would be abused who

66
00:03:51.940 --> 00:03:55.060
was watching this. There would be someone watching this who was mistreated,

67
00:03:56.180 --> 00:03:57.680
sinned against, cheated on.

68
00:03:58.640 --> 00:04:02.390
Someone who through harsh words has been abused and

69
00:04:02.460 --> 00:04:06.240
made to feel less worthy and more broken and more

70
00:04:06.320 --> 00:04:06.740
ashamed.

71
00:04:07.820 --> 00:04:11.760
And I felt strongly that the Lord wanted me to come to you and say that

72
00:04:11.800 --> 00:04:12.770
He is healing

73
00:04:13.680 --> 00:04:14.660
that part of you,

74
00:04:16.180 --> 00:04:17.680
and He's making it beautiful again,

75
00:04:19.541 --> 00:04:20.840
and that He's making it whole

76
00:04:21.740 --> 00:04:23.300
so that even the broken parts

77
00:04:24.300 --> 00:04:27.740
that have made you feel ashamed, that you feel like you have to wall off that part

78
00:04:27.800 --> 00:04:30.000
of you and say, "Holiness doesn't touch that."

79
00:04:31.160 --> 00:04:31.760
But instead,

80
00:04:32.900 --> 00:04:35.640
you need to throw open some long-closed doors

81
00:04:36.600 --> 00:04:39.520
and let the healing holiness of God come in,

82
00:04:40.440 --> 00:04:44.360
and let the Spirit's wholeness-creating presence come into that

83
00:04:44.380 --> 00:04:46.220
part of your life to see things

84
00:04:47.220 --> 00:04:50.800
nobody else can see and to touch things that you've always felt no one

85
00:04:50.860 --> 00:04:51.880
else could touch.

86
00:04:53.280 --> 00:04:56.790
I felt strongly that I was supposed to say this to you today because I believe this

87
00:04:56.820 --> 00:05:00.540
is for you. It might not be for anybody else.

88
00:05:01.220 --> 00:05:01.700
It's for you.

89
00:05:02.680 --> 00:05:04.740
You know who I am. You know who I'm talking to right now.

90
00:05:06.380 --> 00:05:07.920
Don't keep those doors closed.

91
00:05:09.260 --> 00:05:11.240
Holiness isn't just something that's for

92
00:05:14.200 --> 00:05:16.880
all these other people. No, holiness is for you.

93
00:05:17.880 --> 00:05:21.780
And God wants to reach down and grab hold of some parts of you and throw

94
00:05:21.820 --> 00:05:25.720
open some things and say, "Let's clean out some of this old bitterness and

95
00:05:25.740 --> 00:05:28.940
this old anger and this old shame and this old hurt.

96
00:05:30.080 --> 00:05:33.380
Let's clean it up, and let's put it back together, and let's make it whole

97
00:05:34.320 --> 00:05:37.120
and healed and beautiful one more time."

98
00:05:39.040 --> 00:05:39.660
We'll see you tomorrow.
